# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Telegram Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (Telegram.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Telegram Core, MTProto Data Centers (DC1-DC5), Web/Clients,
#              Media CDNs, Telegraph, Fragment/TON Ecosystem, Processes & ASNs.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,Telegram.list,Telegram,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Telegram Core, Shorteners & Web Clients (核心主站、短链、网页版与内嵌预览)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram.dog
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram.space
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,t.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tx.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tdesktop.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tg.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,contest.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Telegram Media CDNs & Telescope Video (图片、大文件、贴纸与圆形视频流分发 CDN)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-telegram.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegram-cdn.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telesco.pe
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stel.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,telegram

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Telegraph Publishing & Instant View (Telegraph 匿名长文发布与即时预览服务)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,telegra.ph
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,graph.org

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Fragment, Username/Number Auctions, Ads & TON Ecosystem (拍卖平台、广告与小程序)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fragment.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,promote.telegram.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,comments.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,quiz.directory
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ton.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ton.app

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Popular Third-Party Telegram Clients (主流第三方客户端更新与云配同步域名)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nicegram.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,swiftgram.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ayugram.one
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,nekogram.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,plusmessenger.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ime.im

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Process & Client User-Agent Rules (macOS / iOS / 跨平台客户端进程与 UA 匹配)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
USER-AGENT,Telegram*
USER-AGENT,Nicegram*
USER-AGENT,Swiftgram*
USER-AGENT,Turrit*
USER-AGENT,Nekogram*
PROCESS-NAME,Telegram
PROCESS-NAME,Telegram Desktop
PROCESS-NAME,TelegramLite
PROCESS-NAME,Swiftgram
PROCESS-NAME,Nicegram
PROCESS-NAME,AyuGram

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Telegram MTProto Data Centers (DC1 - DC5) Core IPv4 & IPv6 Blocks (核心数据中心 IP 段)
# 极其重要：Telegram 客户端绝大部分聊天、图片、语音通话直接通过 MTProto 协议连接裸 IP，
#           不发起任何 DNS 域名请求！因此 IP-CIDR 与 IP-ASN 是 Telegram 分流的绝对核心。
#   - DC1 (US, Miami):         149.154.172.0/22
#   - DC2 & DC4 (NL, Amsterdam): 149.154.160.0/20, 149.154.164.0/22, 149.154.168.0/22
#   - DC3 (US, Miami):         149.154.172.0/22
#   - DC5 (SG, Singapore):     91.108.56.0/22, 185.76.151.0/24
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IP-CIDR,91.105.192.0/23,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,95.161.64.0/20,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,109.239.140.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,139.59.210.98/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,185.76.151.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,196.55.216.167/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,205.172.60.0/22,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:67c:4e8::/48,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:b28:f23c::/47,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2001:b28:f23f::/48,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a0a:f280::/32,no-resolve

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Telegram Official ASNs (Telegram 全球五大官方自治系统号兜底)
#   - AS62041 (Telegram Messenger Inc - Europe/Global)
#   - AS62014 (Telegram Messenger Inc - Core DC)
#   - AS59930 (Telegram Messenger Inc - Asia/Singapore DC5)
#   - AS44907 (Telegram Messenger Inc - CIS/Eastern Europe)
#   - AS211157 (Telegram Messenger Inc - New Anycast Blocks)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IP-ASN,62041,no-resolve
IP-ASN,62014,no-resolve
IP-ASN,59930,no-resolve
IP-ASN,44907,no-resolve
IP-ASN,211157,no-resolve
